Create or update `midwest24-core-drive.http` as the command/reference page for Midwest24 Core Drive, our Nextcloud-based file platform.

Document the operational configuration for the Nextcloud migration and Google Drive import workflow.

Include:

1. Purpose
- Midwest24 Core Drive is the branded Nextcloud file platform.
- Nextcloud app/config stays on FastPool.
- User data lives on IronWolfPool.
- Google Drive is still temporarily used as an upstream source until migration is complete.

2. Final storage architecture
- FastPool/AppData/nextcloud-config = Nextcloud application/configuration.
- IronWolfPool/nextcloud-data = live Nextcloud user data.
- IronWolfPool/google-import = staging import from Google Drive.

3. Verified live data path
Commands:
php occ config:system:get datadirectory
df -h /var/www/html/data

Expected:
datadirectory = /var/www/html/data
filesystem = IronWolfPool/nextcloud-data

4. rclone role
- rclone handles Google Drive → google-import.
- It is not the same as rsync.
- It uses the Google Drive API.
- Current source:
gdrive-backup:/
- Current destination:
/mnt/IronWolfPool/google-import/

5. rsync role
- rsync handles local filesystem copy from google-import → Nextcloud native data.
- Source:
/google-import/Master File/
- Destination:
/var/www/html/data/greasy42/files/Master File/

6. Standard workflow
Google Drive
→ rclone
→ IronWolfPool/google-import
→ rsync
→ IronWolfPool/nextcloud-data
→ php occ files:scan
→ Nextcloud web/desktop clients

7. Monitoring commands
Include:
ps aux | grep -E "rclone|rsync" | grep -v grep
pgrep -a rclone
pgrep -a rsync
tail -f /home/truenas_admin/logs/migration.log
sudo du -sh /mnt/IronWolfPool/google-import

8. Nextcloud scan commands
Include:
php occ files:scan --path="greasy42/files/Master File" -vvv
php occ files:scan --all

9. FastPool cleanup note
Document that obsolete dataset was removed:
FastPool/AppData/nextcloud-config/userdata

Keep:
FastPool/AppData/nextcloud-config

10. Safety rules
- Do not delete google-import yet.
- Do not delete Google Drive yet.
- Do not delete FastPool/AppData/nextcloud-config.
- Do not run multiple rclone jobs against the same destination.
- Use copy for future migration-safe imports unless intentionally mirroring.
- Always scan Nextcloud after direct filesystem changes.

Format it as a practical `.http` / command notebook page for use in VSCodium, with comment headings and copy/paste-ready shell command blocks.